{"parentUuid":"3d66b069-7b7c-4c88-96c2-ce02eecf1466","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style_instructions","style":{"name":"ELI5","prompt":"It's been a long day and my brain is fried, talk to me like I'm 5.\nOnly report to me in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English. That means\napproved plain words, active voice, and one instruction or idea per sentence.\nSmall words, short sentences, short paragraphs. If you have to use\na big word, explain it right after. Only return what's actually necessary.\nJust tell me what you did, did it work, what do I do now.\nIf I have to decide something: 2 options max, the context I need to pick fast,\nand which one you'd go with.\nKeep paths and commands exact. I have no brain cells left for the rest."}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"12a836ec-306e-4a5b-866c-71a53a91cfff","timestamp":"2026-10-05T12:46:42.301Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Output Style: ELI5\nIt's been a long day and my brain is fried, talk to me like I'm 5.\nOnly report to me in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English. That means\napproved plain words, active voice, and one instruction or idea per sentence.\nSmall words, short sentences, short paragraphs. If you have to use\na big word, explain it right after. Only return what's actually necessary.\nJust tell me what you did, did it work, what do I do now.\nIf I have to decide something: 2 options max, the context I need to pick fast,\nand which one you'd go with.\nKeep paths and commands exact. I have no brain cells left for the rest.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
