h\nb0e348d STATUS: Mac step to load the slate-status mod\n0d491bc STATUS: work-organization pass steps 1-8 (Windows)\nd3949cc router: mark 41 repos archived 2026-10-03 (GitHub read-only, local in DEV_archive_hold)\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
