on pass, step 1 of 9 done.** Plan + decisions: `docs/inventory/`.\n  - `portfolio.py`: lanes now `job, side, system, knowledge, tool` (side = personal, outside the cap; slate still counts only `lane: job` + `active`). Statuses add `merged` (needs `parent`) and `archived`. Optional `parent` (must name a project, not itself) and `drive_folder` (string). `board_ops.ARCHIVED` includes the two new statuses so they leave the board.\n  - Tests: `TestOrganizationFields`, `TestRetiredStatusesAreNotLive`. Live registry still validates.\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 2 done.** `portfolio.json` backfilled to 159 rows (every DEV folder + 22 Drive-only projects); inbox emptied into projects. Script + reviewed preview: `docs/inventory/backfill_2026-10-03.py`, `2026-10-03-backfill-preview.md`. Slate unchanged (5 of 5). `render.py` now finds DEV as its own parent folder (was `~/DEV`, which broke on Windows).\n- 2026-10-03: **Fall slate cleared by Eric** (no progress): all 5 job projects paused, charters kept. `slate-check` now reports DUE only for next_up NCAA_BestPractices_Doc.\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 3 done.** `crosswalk.py` + `portfolio.py crosswalk [--json] [--dev-root] [--drive-root]`: report-only drift between registry, DEV and Drive `01_PROJECTS` (unregistered folders with a family hint, missing folders, STATUS with no `## Next` item on active/paused repos committed after 2026-09-12, Drive unreachable = DRIFT never OK). Drive root: `PORTFOLIO_DRIVE_ROOT`, else `G:/My Drive/...` or the Mac CloudStorage path. First run: 10 items (7 stub STATUS, Drive `_ACTIVE/2026-03-26_DexaProject` + `graphify-out` unregistered, WomensHealth Drive folder not created yet). Board: all 5 lane tabs, `unstaged` column for backfilled rows, family line on cards, merged/archived in Archive. Verified on a scratch copy with headless Chrome.\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 4 done.** `closeout` (Step 1 + verdict line) and `weekly-review` (Step 1 health line + Pipeline hygiene) run `portfolio.py crosswalk`, report-only; path comes from `portfolio_json` in `skills/_shared/config.<platform>.json` (present on both). Skills commit in `~/.claude/skills`.\n- 2026-10-03: crosswalk scans depth 2 (group folders like `Football/`, repos holding repos like `SpecialRequests/`), skips hidden folders, junctions (`LibraryProject/ZoteroInjestion`) and children of retired rows, flags `not_a_repo` (AthleticMedicineReviews), and only reads git history for folders with their own `.git` (otherwise `git log` reads the DEV root repo). Found 14 sub-repos with no row (12 Football, 2 SpecialRequests): step-2 gap, decisions pending.\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 5 done.** 15 repos touched after 9/12 got a `## Next` item (7 from evidence, 8 \"Eric to name one\"), one commit each, pushed. The 45 untouched repos stay blank on purpose: no evidence, and crosswalk only flags touched repos. Round 4 (Football sub-repos, private_children) recorded in `docs/inventory/`. Crosswalk now: 4 items, all Drive/file moves for steps 7-8 (AthleticMedicineReviews zip, Drive `_ACTIVE/2026-03-26_DexaProject` + `graphify-out`, WomensHealth folder).\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 6 done (Windows).** 41 merged/archived repos: re-checked clean + pushed at action time, `gh repo archive`d, local folders moved to `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03` (outside the Drive-backed DEV). token-dashboard (third-party clone) deleted. Audit: `docs/inventory/2026-10-03-archive-audit.md`; script `archive_pass.py`; list `2026-10-03-archived-folders.txt`. Router docs (FOOTBALL/PERFORMANCE/PLATFORM/PROGRAM.md) mark them archived. KeystoneOS `data/projects.json` still lists them until the next `keystone.ps1 inventory`.\n- 2026-10-03: **Org step 7 done.** Drive: deleted the 108-byte Mac symlink stub `00_Primary_Storage_Drive/00_Primary_Storage_Drive`, empty `08_ARCHIVE/2026`, empty `_Mark_for_Deletion`; `08_ARCHIVE/PERSONAL` -> `10_ARCHIVE/PERSONAL`, `08_ARCHIVE` removed; 25 loose My Drive root files -> `00_INBOX`. Pipeline folders kept at root (`Zotero_PDFs` = Z