passes alone. Run the affected files, then the full suite more than once.\n- 2026-10-03: **PM system built, all 9 outline stages** (branch `worktree-pm-stage1-board-polling`, draft PR; design `docs/project-management-system-design.md`, stage-1 plan `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-03-pm-stage1-board-polling.md`). Each stage verified in headless Chrome on a scratch registry copy; suite 309 tests (render's removed), green twice.\n  1. Polling: `GET /api/changes?names=` hashes registry stat + shown rows' `docs/STATUS.md` mtimes; page polls 3 s, defers while typing/dragging.\n  2. Resume cards (`cards.py`): stands = newest dated STATUS entry outside Next/Open questions/Gotchas (wrapped lines joined), next = first real Next item, touched = landed; registry fallbacks. Ride along in `/api/registry`.\n  3. Focus view (active + paused touched 14 d + charter date in 14 d), All rows toggle, search across lanes; drops translate visible position to full column.\n  4. Receiver: `portfolio.RECEIVER_LANES` job/side/tool, `receiver_of`/`receiver_needed`; bare \"me\" refused; editable on the card.\n  5. `board_ops._guard_cap` = the one slate-cap check (status, lane move, promote); page Start/Park/Done and new `portfolio.py set-status` share it; 7-day countdown on cards.\n  6. `board.py --background` + temp-dir pid/port file: one board per machine. `pm` in the Windows PowerShell profile, `/pm` mod (dotclaude `068bdf0`), dev-sync Step 4b (claude-skills `d7ad390`).\n  7. `portfolio.py card-check` (cards + gaps for projects touched today); closeout fixes gaps, `data: board edits` commit, cards last (claude-skills `48c5e9d`). Header: N unpushed registry edits.\n  8. `sweep.py` + `portfolio.py sweep` / `sweep-decide` (revive / keep → `parked_until` +90 d / archive); weekly-review Step 4b (claude-skills `8210e09`). Header: N paused rows awaiting a decision (85 today).\n  9. `render.py`, `dashboard.html`, `pulse.md` retired; Artifact frozen with a banner (v24); `/project` skill (claude-skills