ried on the Mac."," - Restart Claude Code so `/pm` loads (mods-sync already run), then open a new PowerShell, type `pm`, and do `docs/GUIDE.md` \"Your first 30 minutes\". (PR #3, the guide, merged 2026-10-03.)"," - CATES draft PR #1 (branch `worktree-cates-status-closeout`, 1 commit not on main): merge or close it; then its worktree can be removed."," - First Friday sweep (2026-10-09): 85 paused rows pending, 10 a week."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage/docs/STATUS.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c499cf6f-6f5a-4a1f-a66e-d59070fdfe76","session_id":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage","sessionId":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
