{"parentUuid":"358ce84f-3e12-4d61-8c4a-4512848a627a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d98f4724-76e5-4177-829b-4e103eff8a1c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AfsyGgWwok48QFbFqJWrpj","type":"tool_result","content":"## master...origin/master","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c9ce6e92-a582-4af6-888c-b165d99bac53","timestamp":"2026-10-05T13:31:55.802Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## master...origin/master","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage/docs/STATUS.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":41,"oldLines":11,"newStart":41,"newLines":10,"lines":[" - 2026-10-03 (evening): **PM system merged** (PR #2, `5ba7647`) and smoke-tested from master: `board.py --background` starts then reuses; `sweep` lists 10 of 85. Restyle pass (neutral greys, system font, gold for 3 things) in the same PR. **Guide** `docs/GUIDE.md` (daily loop, reading a card, 30-minute walkthrough) in PR #3. Workflow guide for the whole setup: `~/DEV/WORKFLOW.md` + visual https://claude.ai/artifact/9kc2jSrPeGCWzyPAQDpcPt. Handoff: `docs/handoffs/2026-10-03-pm-system-build.md`."," - 2026-10-03 (late): **Handoff follow-through (Windows).** `mods-sync.ps1` run: 10 mods loaded, 0 invalid (restart pending). `~/.codex/config.toml` model `gpt-6.1-sol` -> `gpt-6-sol` (gpt-6-sol and gpt-6-astra both answered a probe). claude-skills, dotclaude, KeystoneOS and DEV root all match origin. The CATES \"leftover\" worktree is draft PR #1 in CATES, not debris; left for Eric."," - 2026-10-04: **Board has a stable URL** so it can be a Mac Dock app (Safari → File → Add to Dock). Port 7474 by default (falls back to a free port if taken; `--port 0` = random). Token made once per machine and kept in `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\pm-board\\token` / `~/.config/pm-board/token` (`PM_BOARD_TOKEN` overrides). On Windows the server no longer sets SO_REUSEADDR, which let a second server silently share a taken port. 3 new tests in `TestSingleInstance`. Full suite: 305 passed, 7 CLI-subprocess failures (WinError 6), the same 7 as master in this session. Phone: no mobile board on purpose (one registry); use Claude on the repo. GUIDE \"As a Mac app\" section.","-- 2026-10-05 (Mac): **Mac handoff items done.** `pm()` in `~/.zshrc`; dotclaude + claude-skills pulled, `mods-sync.sh` (10 loaded); the hardcoded dcg hook was back in `settings.json` and is parked in `git -C ~/.claude stash` (drop it once Windows is fine). `mac_archive_pass.sh --go`: 39 moved to `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03`, 3 already absent, token-dashboard deleted, `com.keystone.commandcentre` stopped + disabled. Dock app added by Eric.","+- 2026-10-05 (Mac): **Mac handoff items done.** `pm()` in `~/.zshrc`; dotclaude + claude-skills pulled, `mods-sync.sh` (10 loaded); the hardcoded dcg hook was back in `settings.json` and is parked in `git -C ~/.claude stash` (drop it once Windows is fine). `mac_archive_pass.sh --go`: 39 moved to `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03`, 3 already absent, token-dashboard deleted, `com.keystone.commandcentre` stopped + disabled. Dock app re-added with the new icon; installed on Windows too (Eric, 2026-10-05)."," - 2026-10-05 (Mac): **App icon.** Codex drew 3 concepts (`assets/icon-candidates/`); A (gold burner ring with cards) is served as `/icon-{32,180,192,512}.png` plus `/manifest.webmanifest` (no `start_url`, so the installed app keeps `?token=`). Tab title is now \"Front Burner\". Installable from Edge/Chrome on Windows (steps in GUIDE \"As a Mac app\"). Suite: 312 ran, 2 crosswalk `TestNestedRepos` failures that also fail on the code before this change."," "," ## Next","-- **Windows:** `git pull` here, `pm`, then install the board as an app from Edge (GUIDE \"As a Mac app\")."," - Fix the 2 failing crosswalk tests (`tests/test_crosswalk.py` `TestNestedRepos`); they fail on master too."," - Restart Claude Code so `/pm` loads (mods-sync already run), then open a new PowerShell, type `pm`, and do `docs/GUIDE.md` \"Your first 30 minutes\". (PR #3, the guide, merged 2026-10-03.)"," - CATES draft PR #1 (branch `worktree-cates-status-closeout`, 1 commit not on main): merge or close it; then its worktree can be removed."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage/docs/STATUS.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"358ce84f-3e12-4d61-8c4a-4512848a627a","session_id":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage","sessionId":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
