{"parentUuid":"d83209e7-4ef9-42bf-8268-57c3f83a290d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfjC5Bn5F8aHwYfw5hRuP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the handoff file."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":156156,"output_tokens":1966,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1966,"cache_read_input_tokens":156156,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfjC5BJYmWKWukuhFpyfi","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"c68105d6-cdfb-4f5c-abce-f3c7ae372eda","timestamp":"2026-10-05T13:45:35.134Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/LibraryProject","sessionId":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"c68105d6-cdfb-4f5c-abce-f3c7ae372eda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfjC5Bn5F8aHwYfw5hRuP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015aNd56miEoKsL39enuG7MQ","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage/docs/handoffs/2026-10-05-mac-startup-and-board-icon.md","content":"# 2026-10-05 (Mac, morning): startup, backup, Mac handoff items, board app icon\n\n## What and why\nMorning `/startup` + `/backup` on the Mac, then the Mac items left by the\n2026-10-03 Windows handoff, then an app icon so the board can be installed as an\napp on both machines.\n\n## Done\n- **dev-sync.** dotclaude and global-memory had diverged from origin (the cause of the\n  two failed nightly backups). Merged; the global-memory conflicts\n  (`transcripts/2026-10-03.md`, `.memsearch-last-run`) kept both sides / the newer\n  stamp. 146 repos checked, 22 pulled, 2 pushed, none dirty.\n- **dcg duplicate hook.** The hardcoded `/Users/kristinarash/.local/bin/dcg` hook was\n  back in `~/.claude/settings.json`. Parked with `git -C ~/.claude stash`, not committed.\n  Drop the stash once Windows is confirmed fine.\n- **Backup** re-run by hand: status OK, 97 jobs, CRASHBOX mounted, receipts verified.\n- **Stack doctor:** handoff healthy. `.errors.log` archived to\n  `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/.errors.log.archived-2026-10-05` and emptied.\n- **Mac handoff items:** `pm()` added to `~/.zshrc`; `mac_archive_pass.sh --go`\n  moved 39 repos to `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03` (3 already absent), deleted\n  token-dashboard, stopped + disabled `com.keystone.commandcentre`.\n- **Board icon.** Codex (`codex exec`, image generation) drew 3 concepts:\n  `assets/icon-candidates/A.png` (chosen: gold burner ring with cards), `B.png`\n  (stacked cards, generic), `C.png` (rejected: reads as a poop emoji).\n  Transparent-corner sizes at macOS icon-grid proportions (824 px tile on a 1024\n  canvas): `assets/icon-{1024,512,192,180,32}.png`.\n  `board.py` serves `/icon-*.png` and `/manifest.webmanifest` without the token.\n  **Decision:** the manifest has no `start_url`, so an installed app reopens at\n  the URL it was installed from, which carries `?token=`. A static start_url\n  would either leak the token or open a board with no data.\n  `board.html` title is now \"Front Burner\" with icon/manifest links.\n  Test: `tests/test_board_server.py::test_icons_and_manifest_are_served_unauthenticated`.\n  Eric re-added the Mac Dock app and installed the board on Windows (Edge); data shows.\n\n## Files changed\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/board.py`, `board.html`, `tests/test_board_server.py`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/assets/icon-*.png`, `assets/icon-candidates/{A,B,C}.png`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/docs/GUIDE.md` (Windows install steps), `docs/STATUS.md`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/portfolio.json` (Eric's board edits, own `data:` commit)\n- `~/DEV/LibraryProject/docs/STATUS.md` (+ ZoteroInjestion pointer)\n- `~/.zshrc`\n\n## Next\n1. Fix the 2 failing tests in `tests/test_crosswalk.py` `TestNestedRepos`\n   (they fail on the code before today's change too).\n2. Drop the dcg stash in `~/.claude` (`git -C ~/.claude stash list`).\n3. Friday 10-09 Harness slot: USER.md and MEMORY.md at 99% of cap; remove the\n   `{HOME}/.codex/memories` root from `KeystoneOS/data/memory-index-paths.json`;\n   look at the `adjudicate-budget-tripped` event of 2026-10-04.\n4. 2026-11-02: delete `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03`.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":156156,"output_tokens":1966,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1966,"cache_read_input_tokens":156156,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_015aNd56miEoKsL39enuG7MQ":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/project-triage/docs/handoffs/2026-10-05-mac-startup-and-board-icon.md","content":"# 2026-10-05 (Mac, morning): startup, backup, Mac handoff items, board app icon\n\n## What and why\nMorning `/startup` + `/backup` on the Mac, then the Mac items left by the\n2026-10-03 Windows handoff, then an app icon so the board can be installed as an\napp on both machines.\n\n## Done\n- **dev-sync.** dotclaude and global-memory had diverged from origin (the cause of the\n  two failed nightly backups). Merged; the global-memory conflicts\n  (`transcripts/2026-10-03.md`, `.memsearch-last-run`) kept both sides / the newer\n  stamp. 146 repos checked, 22 pulled, 2 pushed, none dirty.\n- **dcg duplicate hook.** The hardcoded `/Users/kristinarash/.local/bin/dcg` hook was\n  back in `~/.claude/settings.json`. Parked with `git -C ~/.claude stash`, not committed.\n  Drop the stash once Windows is confirmed fine.\n- **Backup** re-run by hand: status OK, 97 jobs, CRASHBOX mounted, receipts verified.\n- **Stack doctor:** handoff healthy. `.errors.log` archived to\n  `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/.errors.log.archived-2026-10-05` and emptied.\n- **Mac handoff items:** `pm()` added to `~/.zshrc`; `mac_archive_pass.sh --go`\n  moved 39 repos to `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03` (3 already absent), deleted\n  token-dashboard, stopped + disabled `com.keystone.commandcentre`.\n- **Board icon.** Codex (`codex exec`, image generation) drew 3 concepts:\n  `assets/icon-candidates/A.png` (chosen: gold burner ring with cards), `B.png`\n  (stacked cards, generic), `C.png` (rejected: reads as a poop emoji).\n  Transparent-corner sizes at macOS icon-grid proportions (824 px tile on a 1024\n  canvas): `assets/icon-{1024,512,192,180,32}.png`.\n  `board.py` serves `/icon-*.png` and `/manifest.webmanifest` without the token.\n  **Decision:** the manifest has no `start_url`, so an installed app reopens at\n  the URL it was installed from, which carries `?token=`. A static start_url\n  would either leak the token or open a board with no data.\n  `board.html` title is now \"Front Burner\" with icon/manifest links.\n  Test: `tests/test_board_server.py::test_icons_and_manifest_are_served_unauthenticated`.\n  Eric re-added the Mac Dock app and installed the board on Windows (Edge); data shows.\n\n## Files changed\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/board.py`, `board.html`, `tests/test_board_server.py`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/assets/icon-*.png`, `assets/icon-candidates/{A,B,C}.png`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/docs/GUIDE.md` (Windows install steps), `docs/STATUS.md`\n- `~/DEV/project-triage/portfolio.json` (Eric's board edits, own `data:` commit)\n- `~/DEV/LibraryProject/docs/STATUS.md` (+ ZoteroInjestion pointer)\n- `~/.zshrc`\n\n## Next\n1. Fix the 2 failing tests in `tests/test_crosswalk.py` `TestNestedRepos`\n   (they fail on the code before today's change too).\n2. Drop the dcg stash in `~/.claude` (`git -C ~/.claude stash list`).\n3. Friday 10-09 Harness slot: USER.md and MEMORY.md at 99% of cap; remove the\n   `{HOME}/.codex/memories` root from `KeystoneOS/data/memory-index-paths.json`;\n   look at the `adjudicate-budget-tripped` event of 2026-10-04.\n4. 2026-11-02: delete `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03`.\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfjC5BJYmWKWukuhFpyfi","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"fa13753e-888d-43de-be7d-15e919b7c0b9","timestamp":"2026-10-05T13:45:47.817Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"67004755-6eb9-4324-a41f-97820a746f73","userType":"external","entrypoint":