{"parentUuid":"7766d282-3646-4b91-aefd-74555fcc2f90","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfjC8yPoZPoazu7Ax4qjR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout: 2026-10-05 (Mac)\n\n**Committed and pushed:**\n- `project-triage`: the board app icon, the web manifest, a test, the Windows install steps, your board edits in their own commit, and the handoff.\n- `LibraryProject`: the ZoteroInjestion link update and a STATUS line.\n- `~/.claude`: session logs. 11 session logs older than 30 days were deleted. Claude Code deletes these on its own, and git history still holds them.\n- `global-memory`: Windows also wrote today's log file. I kept both versions, so no lines were lost.\n\n**STATUS.md:** updated in `project-triage` and `LibraryProject`.\n\n**Memory:** OK. The error log is empty. Today's log file exists. Repo docs were copied into the memory search (107 repos).\n\n**Handoff:** `~/DEV/project-triage/docs/handoffs/2026-10-05-mac-startup-and-board-icon.md`\n\n**Registry drift:** 17 items, found by `portfolio.py crosswalk`. Some examples: 3 rows point to folders that are not at that spot, and 3 Drive folders have no row. None of them come from today.\n\n**Still open:**\n1. 2 tests fail in `tests/test_crosswalk.py`. They failed before today's change too.\n2. The extra dcg hook is held in `git -C ~/.claude stash`. Drop it once Windows works.\n3. Friday 10-09 Harness slot: USER.md and MEMORY.md are at 99% of their size limit. Also remove the `.codex/memories` index path, and look at the budget trip from 10-04.\n4. 2026-11-02: delete `~/DEV_archive_hold/2026-10-03`.\n\nClear to sign off.\n\n**Cards:** 2 projects touched today, both with no gaps.\n- **Project_Triage:** the app icon is done. Next: fix the 2 crosswalk tests.\n- **Ask_The_Library:** only the link update. Next: you name one.\n\nSee you this evening."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"